        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "A template site looks fine on the day it goes live. Then the problems show up: it loads slowly on mobile, Google indexes half the pages, the contact form sends enquiries to an inbox nobody checks, and every small change needs the original freelancer, who no longer replies."
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "We fix that at the source. Every website we build has a clear structure planned around what your customers search for, fast hand-written code, and a lead form connected to Telegram or your CRM, so enquiries reach a person within minutes."
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "When the project is done, the source code, domain, hosting and analytics accounts are yours. You can keep working with us or hand the site to any other team."
